    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "note": "Vendors libopus 1.6.1 (opus/ identical to 0.7.7, which was compared with the release tarball; build.rs differs only in CPU-feature and static-runtime handling) and builds it with CMake (cmake crate) in its build script; the build script reads Cargo/Android variables, runs `ninja --version`, no network. opus/ compared file by file with the official opus-1.6.1.tar.gz (downloads.xiph.org, SHA-256 6ffcb593...a1 = Xiph's SHA256SUMS.txt): 481 of 482 files identical, CMakeLists.txt = upstream + the crate's opus.patch (MSVC runtime selection, ENABLE_OSCE_BWE), checked by applying the patch. The DNN weight files are only compiled with the dred/osce features, which axross-amp does not enable. No binary, no YARA threat. No binary; checksum = crates.io's; published by DoumanAsh on 2026-10-26."
   },
